{"id":"nce2-007","book":"nce2","numbers":[7],"label":"Lesson 7","titleEn":"Too Late","titleCn":"为时太晚","audio":"media/lessons/nce2/007.mp3","lines":[{"t":9.23,"en":"Did the detectives save the diamonds?","cn":"侦探们把那些钻石救出来了吗？"},{"t":14.04,"en":"The plane was late and detectives were waiting at the airport all morning.","cn":"飞机晚点了，侦探们一整个上午都在机场等待。"},{"t":20.38,"en":"They were expecting a valuable parcel of diamonds from South Africa.","cn":"他们原本期待从南非收到一包裹价值连城的钻石。"},{"t":26.06,"en":"A few hours earlier,","cn":"几个小时之前，"},{"t":28.29,"en":"someone had told the police that","cn":"有人向警方报告了这件事。"},{"t":30.52,"en":"thieves would try to steal the diamonds.","cn":"小偷们会试图偷走那些钻石。"},{"t":34.32,"en":"When the plane arrived,","cn":"当飞机降临时，"},{"t":36.57,"en":"some of the detectives were waiting","cn":"一些侦探正在等待。"},{"t":38.7,"en":"inside the main building","cn":"在主楼内"},{"t":40.8,"en":"while others were waiting on the airfield.","cn":"而其他人则正在机场等待。"},{"t":44.89,"en":"Two men took the parcel off the plane","cn":"两名男子从飞机上取下了那个包裹。"},{"t":48.13,"en":"and carried it into the Customs House.","cn":"然后将其带到了海关大楼。"},{"t":51.8,"en":"While two detectives were keeping guard at the door,","cn":"当两名侦探在门口站岗时，"},{"t":55.93,"en":"two others opened the parcel.","cn":"另外两个人打开了那个包裹。"},{"t":58.93,"en":"To their surprise,","cn":"令他们惊讶的是，"},{"t":60.98,"en":"the precious parcel was full of stones and sand!","cn":"那个珍贵的包裹里装的全是石头和沙子！"}],"words":[{"word":"detective","phonetic":["di'tektiv"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"侦探","us":"media/words/nce2/w0046_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0046_e.mp3"},{"word":"airport","phonetic":["'eəpɔ:t"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"机场","us":"media/words/nce2/w0047_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0047_e.mp3"},{"word":"expect","phonetic":["ik'spekt"],"pos":"v.","meaning":"期待，等待","us":"media/words/nce2/w0048_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0048_e.mp3"},{"word":"valuable","phonetic":["'væljuəbəl","-jubəl"],"pos":"a.","meaning":"贵重的","us":"media/words/nce2/w0049_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0049_e.mp3"},